=== Episode 8: Desserts (Quarterfinals) ===
The signature challenge tasked the bakers with making 12 mini baked cheesecakes, in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. For the technical challenge, Prue set a 17th-century bake: 2 [[sussex pond pudding]]s using [[Suet pudding|suet]] pastry and served with [[creme anglaise]], in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were given the enormous task of making a jelly art design cake, composed of an artistic jelly design, a mousse and a baked sponge element in {{frac|4|1|2}} hours.{{sticky header}}{{table alignment}}
