=== Episode 10: Final ===
For the final signature challenge, the finalists were tasked with making 8 beautifully decorated custard slices in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. For the final technical challenge, Prue asked the bakers to make 8 identical walnut whirls—a cone of chocolate with marshmallow inside, a biscuit base, and topped with walnuts—in 2 hours. For the final showstopper challenge, the bakers were tasked with making a colossal, spectacular dessert tower with a large cake at the base and at least 3 sections to represent the different baking disciplines, in {{frac|4|1|2}} hours.

The judges said this was the closest final in the history of the show.{{citation needed|date=January 2025}}

