In the US, collection 8 was ranked amongst the top 10 most-streamed shows in the US, according to Nielsen's streaming rankings for the week of October 12.<ref>{{Cite news|last=Meadows|first=Sam|date=2020-11-13|title=Great British Bake Off breaks into top 10 most-streamed shows in the USA|language=en-GB|work=The Telegraph|url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/news/2020/11/13/great-british-bake-breaks-top-10-most-streamed-shows-usa/|access-date=2021-09-11|issn=0307-1235}}</ref> With 674 million minutes streamed, the show was the 5th most watched program on Netflix for the week.<ref>{{Cite web|last=Thorne|first=Will|date=2020-11-12|title='The Great British Baking Show' Bursts Into Nielsen's Streaming Top 10 List|url=https://variety.com/2020/tv/news/great-british-baking-show-nielsen-streaming-top-10-list-1234830491/|access-date=2021-09-11|website=Variety|language=en-US}}</ref>

